==Welsh==

===Letter===
{{head|cy|letter|upper case||lower case|ch|mixed case|Ch}}

# ''[[èch]]'', the fourth letter of the Welsh alphabet, after ''[[C]]'' and before ''[[D]]''

====Usage notes====
Lke the other Welsh digraphs, {{m|cy|CH}} is considered a distinct letter of the Welsh alphabet for all purposes, including collation. Thus, {{m|cy|chwech|CHWECH}} is alphabetically sorted '''after''' {{m|cy|cyllell|CYLLELL}}.